 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'start 4': signal, new secret base, marker 4, marker 1; these count toward the 60. There is no Objective; A New Secret Base (Third Anthology) deploys on the 1st marker, so Hoth: Main Power Generators (1st Marker) is the starting location (same reading as the author's 'i hate frost bite', 15553). The Signal is listed in the starting group but is not a starting interrupt.",
  "Posted 'marker 4' dested Hoth: North Ridge (4th Marker) and 'marker 1' Hoth: Main Power Generators (1st Marker) (the only Light 4th/1st marker sites); 'corusant' dested Coruscant (Light) (Special Edition) and 'kiffex' the Light Kiffex (Jabba's Palace).",
  "Posted 'x-wing 11' = 11 X-wing; 'lt blunt' dested Lieutenant Blount; 'asp 707 droid' dested ASP-707 (Ayesspee); 'x wing canon x2' dested X-wing Laser Cannon (the draft had A-wing Cannon); 'the planet thats the fartest' dested The Planet That It's Farthest From; 'eject' dested the Effect Eject! Eject!; 'hojix the combo x2' dested Houjix & Out Of Nowhere; 'masaya' dested Masanya; 'red leader in 1' dested Red Leader In Red 1.",
  "Section headers 'people 3' and 'admiral command 1' are not cards. Total 60 as published (3 copies of The Signal: one in the starting group plus 'the signal x2').",
  "The strategy says the deck is 'still undefeated in 2 tournaments' (no event named); kept general."
